			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Due to changes in my RL circumstances, I am looking for volunteer reporters for the guild news.
<br />

<br />
Ideally you will have the following:
<br />

<br />
-Good reporting skills
<br />
-Place to host images on the web
<br />
-Ability to edit images (crop, resize, convert to jpg, adjust brightness and contrast)
<br />
-Working knowledge of forum usage (BBC Codes, etc..)
<br />
-About 2 free hours a week (maximum)
<br />

<br />
Anyone accepted will be asked to cover all guild events they attend, as well as any other happenings in the guild.  As well, they are free to post Everquest news from any source they see fit.
<br />

<br />
Please PM me if you are interested.
<br />

<br />
Thanks =)<br />_________________<br /><img src="http://darkinheritance.com/serrik/SerrikSig3.jpg" border="0" />
